Static Website Deployment

Dependencies are installed in VM

IIS Feature should be installed in Windows
Nginx/Apache2/Httpd should be installed in Linux

DotNet Application -> 
Java Application
Python Application
NodeJS 

U need to take care in VM

IAAS

PAAS

Actually OS, Dependencies updates completely taken care by Azure

U GIVE AUZRE UR APPLLICATION CODE, AND AZURE MANAGES THE WEBSERVER, OS, PATCHING,
AVAILABILITY, SCALLING AND MUCH OF INFRASTRUCUTRE

AZURE APP SERVICE IS A PAAS 
USED TO HOST WEB APPLLICATIONS, REST APIs and BACKEND APPLLICATIONS
WITHOUT MANAGING THE UNDERLYING SERVERS

AZURE APP SERVICE SUPPORTS APPLLICATIONS BUILT WITH TECHNOLOGIES
SUCH AS .NET/ASP.NET CORE ,JAVA, NODEJS. PYTHON, PHP AND CUSTOM DOCKER CONTAINERS

DEVELOPER -> GITHUB/AZURE DEVOPS --> AZURE APP SERVICE -- USERS


IMPORTANT COMPONENTS:
---------------------
1. APP SERVICE PLAN
-------------------
THE APP SERVICE PLAN PROVIDES THE COMPUTE RESOURECS WHERE UR APPLLICATION RUNS.

APP SERVICE PLAN = SERVER/COMPUTE CAPACITY
WEB APP = YOUR APPLLICATION

ONE APP SERVICE PLAN CAN HOST MULTIPLE WEB APPS

DIFF PRICING TIERS PROVIDE DIFF FEATURES SUCH AS 
SCALLING, DEPLOYMENT SLOTS, CUSTOM DOMAINS, BACKUPS AND HIGHER COMPUTE CAPACITY


2. WEB APP
THIS IS THE ACTUAL APPLICATION U DEPLOY

RESOURCE GROUP
    |
    -- APP SERVICE PLAN
            |
            |--- WEBAPP-FRONTEND
            |--- WEBAPP-API
            |--- WEBAPP-ADMIN

ALL 3 APPLICATIONS CAN SHARE THE SAME APP SERVICE PLAN RESOURECS

3. DEPLOYMENT
---------------
APPLICATIONS CAN BE DEPLOYED USING SERVERAL METHODS, INCLUDING

VISUAL STUDIO
VS CODE
GITHUB ACTIONS
AZURE DEVOPS PIPELINES
GIT
ZIP DEPLOYMENT
AZURE CLI/PWSH
DOCKER CONTAINER


Deployment Slots
one of the most useful app service Feature in deployment Slots

for example
Production Slot
https://myapp.azurewebsites.net              1.0    1.5

Stagging Slot:
https://myapp-stagging.azurewebsites.net     1.5    1.0

1.0     -> Endusers

1.5